      "lineNbr": 693,
      "author": {
        "id": 1930620
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-11T15:42:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, `System.out` flushes on newlines (`from println`) by default.",
      "parentUuid": "1394bf50_564a8597",
      "revId": "95b105671e5eb57434303088a0291b81e8de1372",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ab2bb19b_6754f705",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityManagerShellCommand.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 693,
      "author": {
        "id": 1930620
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-11T15:50:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh this is a `PrintWriter`. It can be configured to auto-flush or not, so we can\u0027t assume it would flush. But the errors at the start of the function (`getErrPrintWriter().println`) also have this problem and they *definitely* don\u0027t flush. Let me fix all of them in a follow-on patch?",
      "parentUuid": "7aa79b41_25ddc7cd",
      "revId": "95b105671e5eb57434303088a0291b81e8de1372",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "21524a1e_74fae709",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityManagerShellCommand.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 693,
      "author": {
        "id": 1320563
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-11T15:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can it be simply fixed by removing the early return and then:\n```\nif (!launched) {\n    out.flush();\n    return 1;\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "ab2bb19b_6754f705",
      "revId": "95b105671e5eb57434303088a0291b81e8de1372",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
